Agentic AI – Autonomous Data Preprocessing using LangChain" refers to building an AI system where autonomous agents perform data preprocessing tasks with minimal human intervention, using the LangChain framework to orchestrate the workflow.

What is Agentic AI?

Agentic AI is an AI system that can:

Understand a goal
Plan the steps to achieve it
Make decisions
Use tools
Execute tasks autonomously
Ask for human approval only when necessary

Unlike a traditional script, an Agentic AI system can decide what to do next based on the data it receives.

=========

What is Autonomous Data Preprocessing?

Before training a machine learning model or performing analysis, raw data must be cleaned and prepared.

Normally, a data scientist manually performs tasks like:

Removing missing values
Eliminating duplicate records
Fixing inconsistent formats
Encoding categorical variables
Scaling numerical features
Detecting outliers
Creating new features

With Agentic AI, these steps are performed automatically by specialized AI agents.

========

Role of LangChain

LangChain acts as the orchestrator that connects multiple agents, LLMs, tools, and memory.

It allows different agents to communicate and execute preprocessing tasks in sequence.

Example Workflow
-----------------

             CSV Dataset
                  │
                  ▼
        Dataset Loader Agent
                  │
                  ▼
       Data Profiler Agent
       (Analyzes the dataset)
                  │
                  ▼
      Missing Value Agent
      (Fill or remove NULL values)
                  │
                  ▼
       Duplicate Removal Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Outlier Detection Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Data Cleaning Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Feature Engineering Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Encoding & Scaling Agent
                  │
                  ▼
      Validation Agent
                  │
                  ▼
        Human Approval (Optional)
                  │
                  ▼
      Clean Dataset Ready for ML

=======

Responsibilities of Each Agent
------------------------------


| Agent                     | Responsibility                                             |
| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| Dataset Loader Agent      | Loads CSV, Excel, SQL, or API data                         |
| Data Profiling Agent      | Checks columns, data types, statistics, and missing values |
| Missing Value Agent       | Detects and fills or removes missing data                  |
| Duplicate Removal Agent   | Finds and removes duplicate rows                           |
| Outlier Detection Agent   | Identifies abnormal values using statistical methods       |
| Data Cleaning Agent       | Corrects formatting issues and invalid entries             |
| Feature Engineering Agent | Creates useful new features from existing data             |
| Encoding Agent            | Converts categorical data into numeric form                |
| Scaling Agent             | Normalizes or standardizes numerical features              |
| Validation Agent          | Ensures the processed data is consistent and ready for use |
| Human Approval Agent      | Allows manual review before finalizing the dataset         |


